# ARC-0008 stage 4 (level 7): Hubris, Tier II Nemesis, Usurp, Master of Laws, Master of Secrets.
# Spec: 50_ENGINEERING/55_Implementation_Specs/SPEC_ARC-0008.md (stage 4). Applied with
#   perl 80_TOOLS_AND_PIPELINE/82_Automation/stats/stats_add.pl <this> --apply      ([fechado] ARC-0008)
# No `using`: every field is written. Numbers: 25.02/FEAT_Kingmaker_Hubris (one extra die: LevelMap Kingmaker_CrossingHubris),
# 25.02/FEAT_Kingmaker_AspectAwakening (nemesis_radius 3), 25.02/FEAT_Kingmaker_Court (master_of_secrets_radius 9),
# 25.01/SPL_Kingmaker_Usurp (level 4, 18 m, once per combat).

@loca KM_HUBRIS_NAME Hubris
@loca KM_HUBRIS_PASSIVE An enemy that begins Reigning on the Wheel gains <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="KINGMAKER_HUBRIS">Hubris</LSTag>. The higher it climbs, the harder it falls - its next Crossing deals an additional [1].
@loca KM_HUBRIS_STATUS Climbed too high. The next Crossing it suffers deals an additional [1].
@loca KM_CROSSING_HUBRIS_DESC Fell from its pride while an ally reigned nearby, and took greater Force damage.
@loca KM_NEMESIS_NAME Nemesis
@loca KM_NEMESIS_DESC When an enemy with <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="KINGMAKER_HUBRIS">Hubris</LSTag> suffers its Crossing, every enemy within [1] of it that is Falling drops to Fallen.
@loca KM_AWAKENED_II_NAME 10 - Wheel of Fortune: Awakened II
@loca KM_AWAKENED_II_DESC Tyche: creatures you set on the Wheel enter one position ahead. Allies you crown begin Reigning, and enemies you cast down begin Fallen.<br><br>Nemesis: when an enemy with Hubris suffers its Crossing, every enemy within [1] of it that is Falling drops to Fallen.
@loca KM_USURP_NAME Usurp
@loca KM_USURP_DESC An ally and an enemy on the Wheel trade places on it.
@loca KM_USURP_EXTRA Choose one ally and one enemy. Two allies or two enemies don't trade.<br><br>Once per combat.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_LAWS_NAME Master of Laws
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_LAWS_STATUS An enemy that attacks the King falls one position further when the Wheel next turns, but never past Fallen and never up to Reigning.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_LAWS_SPELL Appoint an ally as Master of Laws. An enemy that attacks the King falls one position further when the Wheel next turns, but never past Fallen and never up to Reigning.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_SECRETS_NAME Master of Secrets
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_SECRETS_STATUS Enemies on the Wheel within [1] can't be <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="INVISIBLE">Invisible</LSTag> or hide. Has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against Falling enemies.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_SECRETS_SPELL Appoint an ally as Master of Secrets. Enemies on the Wheel within [1] of it can't be <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="INVISIBLE">Invisible</LSTag> or hide, and it has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against Falling enemies.
@loca KM_EXPOSED_NAME Exposed
@loca KM_EXPOSED_DESC The Master of Secrets has its measure. Can't become <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="INVISIBLE">Invisible</LSTag> or hide.
@loca KM_COURT_LEVEL7_NAME The Court: second circle

